contentText:
Noel Gallagher , as is his nature, had some blunt words for non-meat-eaters while guesting on the Chicken Shop Date episode posted Friday (Oct. 23).

When asked at the start by host Amelia Dimoldenberg whether he liked chicken nuggets, the Oasis legend replied, &#8220;Who doesn&#8217;t?&#8221;

